The official Docker path does attempt an editable install, including during `setup.py --fast-path`. The emulation also unpacks wheels again on its second dependency-setup call, while Docker uses a per-container marker. I’m checking whether that second extraction restores wheel code over the editable install, and whether pytest changes the import path after the probe runs.
