codex
For `fastapi_14873`, the gold patch changes `fastapi/routing.py`; the test patch changes only `tests/test_router_events.py`. They do not overwrite each other. The stronger explanation is dependency version sensitivity: older Starlette resets the handler lists during construction, while the selected Starlette 1.6.0 wheel no longer does. That explains how the workspace source can pass this test without the gold change.
